### Argus 照片管理系统 - 用户管理接口测试
### 服务器地址
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@apiBase = {{baseUrl}}/api/v1

### ===== 用户管理接口测试 =====

### 获取所有用户
GET {{apiBase}}/users

### 获取指定用户
GET {{apiBase}}/users/1

### 创建新用户
POST {{apiBase}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "age": 25
}

### 创建新用户 (测试用户2)
POST {{apiBase}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "photographer",
  "email": "photo@example.com",
  "password": "photo123",
  "age": 30
}

### 更新用户信息
PUT {{apiBase}}/users/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "updateduser",
  "email": "updated@example.com",
  "age": 26
}

### 更新用户密码
PUT {{apiBase}}/users/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "password": "newpassword123"
}

### 部分更新用户信息
PATCH {{apiBase}}/users/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "age": 27
}

### 删除用户
DELETE {{apiBase}}/users/1

### ===== 用户验证和认证 =====

### 用户登录 (如果有认证系统)
POST {{apiBase}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 用户注册 (如果有认证系统)
POST {{apiBase}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "newuser",
  "email": "new@example.com",
  "password": "newpass123",
  "age": 28
}

### ===== 用户查询和筛选 =====

### 根据用户名搜索
GET {{apiBase}}/users?username=test

### 根据邮箱搜索
GET {{apiBase}}/users?email=example.com

### 分页获取用户
GET {{apiBase}}/users?page=1&limit=10

### 按年龄范围筛选用户
GET {{apiBase}}/users?age_min=20&age_max=40

### 按创建时间排序
GET {{apiBase}}/users?sort=created_at&order=desc

### ===== 错误测试 =====

### 测试获取不存在的用户
GET {{apiBase}}/users/999

### 测试创建用户 - 缺少必需字段
POST {{apiBase}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "incomplete"
}

### 测试创建用户 - 无效邮箱格式
POST {{apiBase}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser2",
  "email": "invalid-email",
  "password": "password123",
  "age": 25
}

### 测试创建用户 - 重复用户名
POST {{apiBase}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "email": "another@example.com", 
  "password": "password123",
  "age": 25
}

### 测试更新不存在的用户
PUT {{apiBase}}/users/999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "nonexistent",
  "email": "none@example.com",
  "age": 30
}

### 测试删除不存在的用户
DELETE {{apiBase}}/users/999

### ===== 使用说明 =====
###
### 1. 用户管理接口用于管理系统用户
### 2. 创建用户时确保提供所有必需字段
### 3. 邮箱地址需要符合有效格式
### 4. 用户名在系统中应该是唯一的
### 5. 支持分页、搜索和排序功能
### 6. 删除用户操作不可逆，请谨慎使用